sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor human as Human
    participant dockB as Dock B and wallet B
    participant billB as Bill B
    participant billA as Bill A
    participant dockA as Dock A and wallet A
    participant chain as Mutinynet

    rect rgb(239, 246, 255)
        human->>dockB: Receive USDT
        dockB->>billB: Read inventory EMPTY
        dockB->>dockB: Create generic witness invoice
        dockB->>dockB: Require SIGNET_CUSTOM and empty endpoints
        dockB-->>billB: Invoice bytes over implemented GATT-dock chunks
        billB-->>human: Display 5 dollars INVOICE TAP
        human->>billA: Press once near Bill B
        billB-->>billA: Invoice chunks over gated GATT-tap
        billA-->>human: Display 5 dollars INVOICE DOCK
        human->>dockA: Send USDT
        dockA->>billA: Read inventory then exact invoice
        billA-->>dockA: Invoice bytes over implemented GATT-dock chunks
    end

    rect rgb(254, 249, 195)
        dockA->>dockA: Read exact spendable RGB balance
        dockA-->>human: Show immutable amount recipient fee and expiry
        human->>dockA: Exact one-use CONFIRM plan id
        dockA->>dockA: Recheck unchanged balance
        dockA->>chain: donation send with witness output
        chain-->>dockA: Broadcast txid and confirmation
        dockA->>dockA: Hash exact rgb-lib consignment bytes
    end

    rect rgb(239, 246, 255)
        dockA-->>billA: Consignment plus denomination over GATT-dock
        billA-->>human: Display 5 dollars PROOF TAP
        human->>billB: Press once near Bill A
        billA-->>billB: Consignment binary frames over gated GATT-tap
        billB-->>human: Display 5 dollars PROOF DOCK
        human->>dockB: Receive USDT
        dockB->>billB: Read inventory then exact consignment
    end

    rect rgb(220, 252, 231)
        dockB->>dockB: Verify content hash and persist isolated inbox copy
        dockB->>dockB: provide_out_of_band_consignment
        dockB->>chain: Refresh and validate witness anchor
        chain-->>dockB: One confirmation
        billB-->>human: Inventory empty and amount hidden
        billA-->>human: Inventory empty and amount hidden
    end

    Note over dockA,dockB: No proxy endpoint and no dock-to-dock Wi-Fi consignment path
    Note over dockA,dockB: Donation mode has no receiver ACK gate
    Note over dockA,dockB: Inventory revision is build verified and awaiting physical acceptance
